<title>USA: Michigan to sell $900 mln GO notes Feb. 5.</title>
<headline>Michigan to sell $900 mln GO notes Feb. 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michigan is expected to sell $900 million of general obligation notes through competitive bidding on February 5 at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>Tucker Anthony Inc will serve as financial adviser.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
